msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Enables plugins on your Mattermost server. See "
"the `Use plugins with Mattermost "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/integrate/plugins/using-and-managing-"
"plugins/>`__ documentation for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:53
msgid "**false**: Disables plugins on your Mattermost server."
msgstr ""

