#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1133
msgid "Upload an image to use as the agent's avatar in Mattermost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1136
msgid "Image upload interface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1147
msgid "Service"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1150
msgid "Select the LLM service provider to use for AI assistance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1153
msgid ""
"Available options: **OpenAI**, **OpenAI Compatible**, **Azure**, "
"**Anthropic**, and **Ask Sage**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1165
msgid "Username"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1168
msgid "The username used to authenticate with the **Ask Sage** LLM service."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1171
msgid "String input required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1182
msgid "Password"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1185
msgid "The password used to authenticate with the **Ask Sage** LLM service."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1188
msgid "String input required. This value is encrypted when stored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1199
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1587
msgid "API URL"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1202
msgid ""
"The endpoint that Mattermost will use to communicate with the LLM's API. "
"Required for **OpenAI Compatible** and **Azure** LLM services."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1206
msgid "String input (URL format)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1217
msgid "API key"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1220
msgid ""
"The key used to authenticate requests to the LLM's API. Required for "
"**OpenAI**, **OpenAI Compatible**, and **Anthropic** LLM services."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1224
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1558
msgid "String input. This value is encrypted when stored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1235
msgid "Organization ID"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1238
msgid ""
"Ensures that requests are billed and processed under the correct "
"organization, where applicable. Supported for **OpenAI**, **OpenAI "
"Compatible**, and **Azure** LLM services."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1255
msgid "Send user ID"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1258
msgid ""
"**true**: Includes unique user identifiers in API requests to the LLM for"
" analytics, personalization, and auditing purposes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1260
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Does not include user identifiers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1262
msgid "Review LLM data privacy policies before enabling this setting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1266
msgid ""
"We recommend reviewing LLM data privacy policies to confirm whether "
"transmitting user information is acceptable and secure within your "
"organization's regulatory framework. Do not enable when you need to "
"conform to strict privacy regulations (e.g., GDPR) that limit sharing "
"user-identifiable data with external services."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1276
msgid "Default model"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1279
msgid ""
"The specific LLM that will be used to process queries if no other model "
"is explicitly selected. Supported for all LLM services."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1283
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1576
msgid "String input (model name)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1294
msgid "Input token limit"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1297
msgid ""
"The maximum number of tokens (chunks of text, including words, "
"punctuation, or special characters) that the selected LLM can process in "
"a single prompt or request."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1301
msgid ""
"Numerical value. Directly impacts the size of user queries that can be "
"handled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1313
msgid "Output token limit"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1316
msgid ""
"The maximum number of tokens (chunks of text, including words, "
"punctuation, or special characters) that the LLM can generate in its "
"response to a query."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1320
msgid "Numerical value. Must be greater than 0 for **Anthropic** LLM services."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1331
msgid "Streaming timeout"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1334
msgid ""
"Determines how long the system will wait for a response from the LLM when"
" using streaming (real-time) output mode. Supported for **OpenAI**, "
"**OpenAI Compatible**, and **Azure** LLM services."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings.rst:1338
msgid ""
"Numerical value (in seconds). If the LLM takes longer than the configured"
" timeout, the connection is terminated."
msgstr ""

